rvives\" might point to a different show entirely. But the \"real-life relative, unrelated in series\" is extremely distinctive and matches the Harmons perfectly.\n\nLet me verify the height clue and check the character details more carefully. The question may have some imprecise clues, but the distinctive \"real-life relative, unrelated in series\" + show criteria strongly point to The 100. Let me search for the actors' heights and the character marriage details.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"Richard Harmon actor height cm\", \"John Murphy The 100 character Emori relationship married\", \"The 100 TV series seasons premiere 2014\"], \"top_k\": 10}","name":"search"},"id":"call_83c86181098e4e208132fe35","index":0,"type":"function"},{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"Jessica Harmon actress height\", \"Niylah The 100 character relationships\"], \"top_k\": 10}","name":"search"},"id":"call_9182dcdde9cb44ff835fb165","index":1,"type":"function"}]},{"content":"{\"action_slot_charged\":true,\"executed\":true,\"ok\":true,\"results\":[{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d177\"},\"ref\":\"d177\",\"snippet\":\" ... The 37-year-old singer, born in Honolulu, stands at 165 cm ( 5' 5\\\"). Some of his films include Honeymoon in Vegas and Rio 2.\\n\\n18. BD Wong – 5 feet 5 inches\\n\\nBradley Darryl Wong is an American actor of Chinese descent. Although his height is 165 cm ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.legit.ng/ask-legit/1505676-short-actors-30-famous-celebrities-6-feet/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d178\"},\"ref\":\"d178\",\"snippet\":\" ... 1\\n\\n- Height: 168 cm\\n\\n- Career: Actress, model, television host, entrepreneur, and recording artist\\n\\nActress Anne Curt